            "image_ratio": "portrait",
            "heading": "Contract",
            "heading_size": "text-2xl lg:text-3xl",
            "text": "<p>For commercial spaces, we offer a range of customisable options, including custom colours and sizes, ensuring that each piece fits seamlessly into the design vision. With many stocked items meaning short lead times, plus warranted products, trade customers can rely on Case to meet their project deadlines with high-quality furniture.</p>",
