        "column_B3N7QQ": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "show_border": false,
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "text_alignment_mobile": "left",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/S17-V2jpg.jpg",
            "image_ratio": "portrait",
            "heading": "Designer",
            "heading_size": "text-2xl lg:text-3xl",
            "text": "<p>From solo interior designers to larger design studios, we’re here to help you with projects of all shapes and sizes. Get personal service with a dedicated account manager who understand your unique needs and will work with you to achieve your design vision. From COM options, to CAD drawings we got you covered.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "column_QgcjDi": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "show_border": false,
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "text_alignment_mobile": "left",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_214.jpg",
            "image_ratio": "portrait",
            "heading": "Wholesale",
            "heading_size": "text-2xl lg:text-3xl",
            "text": "<p>Through experienced large-volume production, strong global manufacturing and a large distribution network, Case is sold worldwide through direct channels and esteemed retailers. We build long lasting relationships, working with our retailers to meet their specific needs.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
